# Components

- Co-locate a `*.stories.tsx` (CSF3) for every component; add `*.test.tsx` for
  logic-bearing or interactive ones.
- Client: `<name>.client.tsx` + `'use client'`. Server: `<name>.tsx` (no directive).
- Use design-token classes — never hardcode colors or font sizes.
- Accessibility is required: pass vitest-axe and the Storybook axe-playwright
  check; no `eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y` violations; never suppress axe globally.

Detail: [packages/ui/README.md](../../packages/ui/README.md) and [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
